            "description": "Declarative trusted-component composition, e.g. {\"component\": {\"name\": \"Status\", \"version\": \"1.0\"}, \"props\": {\"label\": {\"$prop\": \"/label\"}, \"tone\": \"positive\"}}. component.name is either a shipped catalog name (e.g. \"Status\", \"Chart\") or another business.<slug> component; component.version is that component's version string. props holds the child component's own props, each either a literal or a {$prop:'/pointer'} binding into this component's own propsSchema. A node may also carry style: {tone?, radius?, size?} from the closed Surface token vocabulary, and children: an array of further view nodes of this same shape.",
